---
description: React 19 + Tailwind frontend conventions — apps/web
globs: apps/web/**/*.tsx,apps/web/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- No router dependency. View switching is `useState` in `App.tsx` — don't add
  `react-router-dom` for a new page without asking first.
- Import types and Zod schemas from `@bookshelf/shared` (type-only named imports);
  never redeclare a shape the shared package already exports.
- All HTTP calls go through `lib/api.ts`'s single `fetchJson` helper — add a new typed
  function there, don't `fetch()` ad hoc from a component.
- Tailwind only, mobile-first (unprefixed = phone; `sm:`/`lg:` scale up); no CSS beyond
  `index.css`.
- Reuse the loading/error/empty-state pattern in `components/states.tsx` rather than
  inventing a new one per page.
